        "Solve for $\\frac{1}{2}x$ within $-\\frac{\\pi}{4} \\le \\frac{1}{2}x \\le \\frac{\\pi}{4}$:\n$$\\frac{1}{2}x = \\tan^{-1}\\left(-\\frac{2}{3}\\right) \\approx -0.588003\\text{ radians}$$",
        "Multiply by $2$ to find $x$:\n$$x = 2(-0.588003) \\approx -1.176 \\approx -1.2\\text{ radians} \\quad (\\text{to 1 d.p.})$$"
